        mountCategory = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 15,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Several timed mechanics, a delicate egg catch and at least four eligible Lei Shen kills for the conduit checklist.\n\n1. Unlock the Isle of Thunder, enter Throne of Thunder at 63.7,32.3 and track 8124. Obtain the first eleven Heroic boss credits through the Twin Empyreans across your eligible runs. Plan multiple weekly visits for the outcome checklists.\n\n2. At Jin'rokh, stop damage and let two Focused Lightning orbs spawn. Have their targeted players bring the orbs together away from conductive water for Lightning Overload. A ranged/healer helper avoids waiting on a target that never receives the mechanic.\n\n3. At Horridon, kill him without killing any Zandalari Dinomancer. At high level a direct boss kill before dinomancers spawn is simplest; if waiting through gates, keep them alive and avoid incidental AoE.\n\n4. At the Council of Elders keep every boss and summoned creature within the centre rings for Cage Match. Stand inside so charges and pursuing loa do not chase a player outside.\n\n5. At Tortos, keep him alive until at least five Whirl Turtles can be lined up. Damage one into its stationary shell state, position behind it and use Kick Shell so ONE kick passes through five other turtles, then finish the boss.\n\n6. At Megaera, choose one missing Head Case restriction per clear: never cut a Flaming head, never cut a Frozen head, or never cut a Venomous head. Kill the other colours until the encounter ends. Repeat on future eligible kills until all three restrictions are credited.\n\n7. For Ji-Kun's Soft Hands, position helpers before pulling. Clear the first lower nest quickly, take a feather and fly toward the upper east-northeast nest near the wall; the golden egg falls from that side shortly after the fight starts. Catch it by physically touching it, not clicking the throw button.\n\n8. Keep the egg intact until Ji-Kun dies. Catching removes the carrier's flight buff; a priest's Leap of Faith or a coordinated throw/catch returns the carrier/egg to the platform. The carrier must not cast normal abilities, trigger reactive effects, fall off or take disallowed attacks. Let another player kill Ji-Kun while the carrier stays safe; reset if the egg breaks.\n\n9. At Durumu, do not damage him while setting up You Said Crossing the Streams Was Bad. During three Light Spectrum phases overlap the beams over the hidden extra fog to reveal Orange, Purple and Green. If the brief white marker is not visible, move with the leading edge of the rotating ground cone while overlapping the other beam. Clear the Crimson Fogs to end each spectrum phase and avoid the lethal beam/knockback between phases. Normal avoids Heroic ice-wall complications.\n\n10. At Primordius, kill the boss without collecting harmful mutations: avoid coloured mutation pools and do not deliberately build extra mutations. A direct high-level boss kill without killing/stepping in blobs is simplest.\n\n11. Before Dark Animus, kill the named Dark Ritualists and check Ritualist Who?'s twenty-four-name list. Different names appear on separate visits; continue eligible clears/characters until every name is credited. Do not assume a fixed number of weeks or that clearing one pack completes the list.\n\n12. At Iron Qon avoid Burning Cinders, Storm Cloud, Rushing Winds, Frozen Blood and Frozen Solid while surviving the encounter. Keep out of spear trails and tornadoes; finish the boss after the required avoidance credit is safe.\n\n13. At the Twin Empyreans, preserve Suen above 30% until Lu'lin is dead for From Dusk 'til Dawn. Use controlled single-target damage, kill Lu'lin first, then finish Suen; do not cleave Suen down early.\n\n14. At Lei Shen, choose a missing A Complete Circuit conduit before the pull. Keep him near that conduit so it has the highest energy when the first transition begins, then confirm it is the first disabled. Finish the encounter and repeat on later eligible clears for Static Shock, Diffusion Chain, Overcharge and Bouncing Bolt, one opening disable per kill.\n\n15. Check every current 8124 criterion, including all three Head Case outcomes, all twenty-four Ritualists and all four opening conduit disables. After the meta completes, learn the Armored Skyscreamer reward from the journal/mail.",
    },
