        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The legacy fight is easy, but random loot and weekly character eligibility can require repeated resets.\n\n1. Fly north from Kun-Lai Summit to the Isle of Giants. Land on the island and approach Oondasta's central arena; the island landing point is not the boss location.\n\n2. Before pulling, check whether this character has already looted Oondasta this week. For an additional eligible roll, bring a Mogu Rune of Fate. Elder Charms can be bought from Mistweaver Ai on the Timeless Isle; Mogu Runes come from Mistweaver Ai's exchange for Timeless Coins.\n\n3. When the boss is attackable, land a damaging hit while it is alive. Let other waiting players tag it; merely standing nearby or arriving after the kill is not a dependable loot claim.\n\n4. Kill Oondasta, check the personal-loot result and use the bonus-roll prompt if you brought the correct token. This outdoor boss can award its mount on a bonus roll; this rule does not apply to instanced raid mounts.\n\n5. If Cobalt Primordial Direhorn is awarded, use its mount item. Otherwise return after the weekly reset or use a different eligible character. Waiting for a respawn on the same already-looted character does not refresh the normal weekly chance.",
