        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The legacy fight is easy, but random loot and weekly character eligibility can require repeated resets.\n\n1. Unlock the Isle of Thunder through Thunder Calls and The Storm Gathers at Shado-Pan Garrison in Townlong Steppes. Follow the offered arrival flight and use your faction's island portal thereafter. Nalak is outside the Throne of Thunder, not at the centre of the island.\n\n2. Before pulling, check whether this character has already looted Nalak this week. For an additional eligible roll, bring a Mogu Rune of Fate. Elder Charms can be bought from Mistweaver Ai on the Timeless Isle; Mogu Runes come from Mistweaver Ai's exchange for Timeless Coins.\n\n3. When the boss is attackable, land a damaging hit while it is alive. Let other waiting players tag it; merely standing nearby or arriving after the kill is not a dependable loot claim.\n\n4. Kill Nalak, check the personal-loot result and use the bonus-roll prompt if you brought the correct token. This outdoor boss can award its mount on a bonus roll; this rule does not apply to instanced raid mounts.\n\n5. If Thundering Cobalt Cloud Serpent is awarded, use its mount item. Otherwise return after the weekly reset or use a different eligible character. Waiting for a respawn on the same already-looted character does not refresh the normal weekly chance.",
