        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - An easy legacy boss but a random drop constrained by weekly raid eligibility.\n\n1. Set legacy raid difficulty to Normal or Heroic before entering Throne of Thunder at the marked outdoor entrance. Use an appropriately high-level character. Do not enter the Raid Finder version for the mount.\n\n2. Clear Jin'rokh, Horridon, Council of Elders, Tortos and Megaera, then continue through the cavern to Ji-Kun. Avoid touching the lethal snails on the approach. Kill Ji-Kun on the main platform and loot her.\n\n3. Check your bags and the loot window for Clutch of Ji-Kun. Use the item if it drops. Save bonus-roll tokens for the outdoor Pandaria world bosses; an extra raid roll cannot produce this mount.\n\n4. If no mount drops, return on the next weekly reset or run the raid on another character. Check Raid Info before accepting a saved group's lockout; Reset All Instances does not restore a killed weekly boss.",
